Meta.documentation:Number.power
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Raises the first Number to the power of each following Number.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first Number in the flow is the base; each following Number is an
Meta.documentation:exponent applied in turn.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_base — the base
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each exponent, applied in order
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the result, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:2 Number:10]>>Number.power:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:1024
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.multiply Number.reciprocate
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20Number%20%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FNumber%22)%3B%0A%0Afunction%20power()%0A%7B%0A%20%20this.Number%20%3D%20new%20Number()%3B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22power%22)%3B%20%2F%2F%20REMOVE%20NAMING%20-%20BUT%20LEAVE%20FOR%20DEBUG%20FOR%20NOW%0A%09this.Processor%3DpowerProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20powerProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Number%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.tempNumber%20%3D%20new%20resource.Number.bigRat(0%2C10)%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_base%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%20%2F%2F%20raise%20error%20if%20not%20called%3F%20%20%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20this.tempNumber%20%3D%20input.value%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%20%20%0A%09%09if%20(this.tempNumber)%0A%09%09%09this.tempNumber%20%3D%20this.tempNumber.pow(input.value)%3B%0A%09%09else%0A%09%09%09this.tempNumber%20%3D%20input.value%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20this.out_Number%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Athis.tempNumber%7D)%3B%20%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Apower.Processor%3DpowerProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dpower%3B]>>NewResource:Number.power
